      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the agency, Mathias finally challenges his client's treatment of the assistants. Later Gabriel asks Sofia about the shoot and encourages her despite a possible cut to her scene. They still use polite French until Sofia asks to change that. Listen to the French first and follow that final request carefully.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
